This repository holds two kinds of material under different terms.

1. Halluminate's own work

   Covers: custodes/, findings/, scores/, single_pass/, every tasks/<benchmark>/<task>/findings.json and
   tasks/<benchmark>/<task>/corrected/CHANGES.md, and the README and documentation files.

