   credit, for non-commercial purposes only, and you may not distribute modified versions of it.

2. Third-party benchmark tasks

   Covers: tasks/<benchmark>/<task>/original/ and the task files in tasks/<benchmark>/<task>/corrected/ (other than
   CHANGES.md). These files come from public releases and stay under their original licenses. Halluminate claims no
   rights in them. The README links to each official source. Where we changed a file, corrected/CHANGES.md says what
   we changed and why.

   - SpreadsheetBench 2 (tasks/spreadsheetbench2/): MIT License, copyright the SpreadsheetBench 2 authors.
     Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/KAKA22/SpreadsheetBench-v2
   - DAYJOB finance (tasks/dayjob/): MIT License, copyright Surge AI.
     Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/surgeai/DAYJOB-finance
   - FINCH (tasks/finch/): Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC BY 3.0), copyright the FINCH authors.
     Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/FinWorkBench/Finch
   - GDPval (tasks/gdpval/): no license is stated on the dataset card, so all rights remain with OpenAI.
     Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/openai/gdpval

